  ('msc-euribia','cbcae04001152e5cca9c0379746b0e26','Euribia''s a beautifully designed ship that shines on northern routes.','The buffet will disappoint you and service can stumble when problems come up.'),
  ('msc-fantasia','f84e5cd57a9be2949787c456da13aca5','Fantasia''s real strength is the price and ports, not the ship herself.','Crowding at the buffet and pool will test your patience, and the buffet food runs cold and repetitive.'),
  ('msc-grandiosa','ed1de4481697992ccea93e402263b12d','Grandiosa is a stunning ship with real European style.','Crowds and rising nickel-and-dime charges can wear on you by week''s end.'),
  ('msc-lirica','ac229ad9f8af6f8ad7ed7ae9a8ebd8e2','Lirica''s a quiet, well-kept ship.','She rewards patience with the food: the buffet''s pickings are slim.'),
  ('msc-magnifica','c16baef438636afe503332a2019e9c87','Magnifica''s a solid mid-size ship with a crew that cares.','The galley''s not keeping pace with what you''d expect, so book a specialty restaurant or plan around the main dining room.'),
  ('msc-meraviglia','aa0f8f525419de6954e9e4d9edd90353','Meraviglia''s crew and shows make it worth the sail.','You''re sharing the decks with six thousand others, so expect lines and a worn feeling in some corners.'),
