  ('msc-opera','a70ad1dd54eefa63501170f0963d01f1','Opera''s a smaller ship with itineraries—Venice and Mozambique routes you won''t find elsewhere.','You''re trading space and smooth operations for the price.'),
  ('msc-orchestra','1b2d5f829d1a04629c6aaae413171f00','Orchestra draws budget cruisers to great Mediterranean ports.','The ship feels crowded in the common areas and nickel-and-diming adds up fast.'),
  ('msc-poesia','f4f3f845bced6dae65f0c9e537af0681','Poesia''s crew and cleanliness are solid.','Sea days feel thin on entertainment and food lands middle-of-the-road.'),
  ('msc-preziosa','b84b9a2b3bd3963499005576e499428c','Preziosa''s a beautiful ship with crew who care.','The dining monotony and thin evening entertainment can make sea days feel long.'),
  ('msc-seascape','5415f399f2d1fe5c67932b9551db65e3','Seascape is striking to look at and Yacht Club is worth it if you can swing it.','Service feels like it depends on which crew member you get.'),
  ('msc-seashore','337aef0cc1e9611ca5bd2a91e1b45b40','Seashore feels more polished than her price tag suggests, and the private island is worth the sail.','The layout will frustrate you until you''ve memorized it.'),
  ('msc-seaside','d38f5c5f38ff6854087b5bb7b9af165d','Seaside shines on short Bahamas runs and Ocean Cay.','The main dining leans repetitive—specialty restaurants are where the food lands.'),
  ('msc-seaview','2dd8e3c14fca3196f4fc815cdc78983d','Seaview shines with some thoughtful design — the balconies are spacious and boarding is smooth.','Peak times get crowded and service slows to a crawl, which wears on you over a week.'),
  ('msc-sinfonia','718802ea8fc10cfe74aadd28fddb518e','Sinfonia''s dining staff and kitchens are strong.','Shore-side booking and communication are messy enough that you''ll want to double-check everything yourself.'),
  ('msc-splendida','efa525f2ca64453bd6a5dca55b71237a','Splendida draws crowds with budget Med itineraries.','You''ll spend a lot of time waiting in line at the buffet and fighting for deck space.'),
  ('msc-virtuosa','6e176156b399a62a196274db5c390599','Virtuosa''s a real looker with top-notch theatre.','The buffet breakfast is a zoo and the noise level runs high, especially on UK sailings packed with families.'),
  ('msc-world-america','f9a81a504f9bbf0feb80fb192526d589','World America is a stunning new ship at a fair price.','Pack patience for crowded sea days and some stretched service when the ship fills up.'),
  ('msc-world-europa','ac2f4096700cbfad9a8cfc2909f13fd0','Europa''s a striking modern ship with real standout spaces.','The standard buffet lags behind what you''d expect at this price point.'),
  ('navigator-of-the-seas','31d8106d909053142b3fe5f84dc8c67a','Navigator''s a real family ship with plenty to do.','The cabins show their age and the crew service can be hit or miss.'),
  ('norwegian-aqua','5475f298e4c678913b1df199de127e24','Aqua''s got a crew that cares.','The ship''s layout will have you lost for days, and the upsell nickel-and-diming wears thin fast.'),
  ('norwegian-bliss','5ee63f14bfdae5d86a80f1baa76c29da','Bliss shines when you''re looking out the window at Alaska.','The onboard experience doesn''t quite match the scenery.'),
  ('norwegian-breakaway','135ec95ab18635384945e65d8a8174cd','Breakaway''s got a good crew and solid specialty dining.','The constant upsells and tight layout can make the experience feel nickel-and-dimed and cramped.'),
  ('norwegian-dawn','54864ac64085615b825c47ff4be9b516','Dawn has real charm on her European routes.','The ship is showing her age — thin walls and dated cabins mean you''re trading newer comfort for good itineraries.'),
  ('norwegian-encore','1c4e1cb19aa60ef278795b53772f70bf','Encore is a beautiful ship with great shows and Alaska itineraries.','Crowds mean you''re fighting for a seat at meals and the service feels thin.'),
  ('norwegian-epic','f069e42ce4f2e0c4e3fc74810d7c2024','Epic''s a fun ship with solid Mediterranean ports.','The cabin layouts are quirky and embarkation can be a real mess—know what you''re booking.'),
  ('norwegian-escape','7c6feab85f011d57c75f3e30ae23e842','The crew''s warmth keeps people coming back.','The ship itself is starting to feel its age and the dining reservations are a hassle to lock in.'),
  ('norwegian-gem','3741fe768154472f52d2c2a62741bb17','Gem shines on itineraries with strong port stops.','The ship itself is aging and the crew sometimes feels spread too thin to keep things seamless.'),
  ('norwegian-getaway','4c703840ea0ba6fe43d0bfe2908da263','Getaway''s a fun ship with a crew that connects with guests.','Nickel-and-diming on dining and entertainment adds up fast.'),
  ('norwegian-jade','43e2cec6fdec8b4ace4822d2ea09c373','Jade shines on Alaska Inside Passage runs where the scenery does the work.','As an older ship she''s light on activities and you''ll notice the wear if you''re expecting newer-ship polish.'),
  ('norwegian-jewel','182751d5d33c0c7259a981a101be4f31','Jewel''s got a relaxed, manageable feel and a crew that''s warm.','Housekeeping corners have been cut in ways that show.'),
  ('norwegian-joy','3c78a0ea5ed0a4b7bf6cf782bd32e3f8','Norwegian Joy shines on Alaska runs where the scenery does the heavy lifting, and the crew connects with passengers.','You''ll feel the ship''s size and crowds elsewhere.'),
  ('norwegian-luna','061f897ff4bfc11148414508e049107a','Luna''s cabins are spacious and the newer ship feel is nice.','The dining swings wildly — some meals land, others fall flat.'),
  ('norwegian-pearl','e7e16508a85b35d57ca375814cf80213','Pearl''s the right size if you want to feel like you''re on a real ship without the chaos of the mega-liners.','The kitchen doesn''t always back up what''s promised on the menu.'),
  ('norwegian-prima','08d810d49e57e79ab998dfb2c00fda47','Prima''s a beautiful ship with a crew that cares.','The public spaces feel cramped and the nickel-and-diming adds up fast.'),
  ('norwegian-sky','64004a991166f9ad1fc2edbea4c74734','Norwegian Sky wins on itineraries and crew heart.','It''s an older, smaller ship — you''re trading big-ship polish for ports.'),
  ('norwegian-spirit','01cc53dd20a8dcb00ad63101635d4a64','Norwegian Spirit shines on those long Asia and South Pacific routes where the itinerary is the real draw.','Expect the dining to wear thin by week two.'),
  ('norwegian-star','16b39677073d733589fda4c7b84b1ba0','Norwegian Star gets you to amazing places—Iceland, South America.','The ship itself feels tired, with old cabins and bathrooms that show their age.'),
  ('norwegian-sun','a222d414ca6a9af0902213977fcb10e4','Norwegian Sun draws seasoned travelers with its itineraries to Africa and Asia.','The dining falls short of what you''d expect, and the shows won''t hold your attention.'),
  ('norwegian-viva','401560be7607ad21828ee25c6bd4a031','Norwegian Viva is a beautiful ship with real style.','The crew service doesn''t quite match what you''d expect, and the entertainment feels like it''s still finding its footing.'),
  ('oasis-of-the-seas','e1e44aee2e7c5f36f3c5a02a4098dc81','Oasis still delivers world-class entertainment and crew service.','She''s feeling her age in the crowds and a few worn corners.'),
  ('odyssey-of-the-seas','73aa6fc080a7e77c8f7f2c72e343639e','Odyssey is solid on crew and food.','When she''s full the ship feels tight — you''ll be hunting for a quiet spot on deck.'),
  ('ovation-of-the-seas','0ff9cf6699caab7d8228e3116e9cef9b','Ovation''s a well-kept ship with dining that punches above the usual line.','The upcharges stack up fast and Alaska itineraries can feel uncertain.'),
  ('pride-of-america','6741e5ca8b84a82f92a80ad15bfbc511','Pride of America gets you to Hawaii ports every single day, which is real and unique.','You''re paying cruise prices for a ship that feels more like a floating hotel than a true cruise experience.'),
  ('quantum-of-the-seas','ffeae722d2c8a0f021ede94a702102df','Quantum''s cabins are comfortable and well kept.','The dining falls short of what you''d expect, which matters when you''re at sea for days.'),
  ('radiance-of-the-seas','309e99312bdd3981a3bee2f3750576c1','The crew keeps things running smooth and the smaller size means you''ll get a seat at dinner.','Radiance feels like a ship that''s been around the block and shows it.'),
  ('regal-princess','52c65c537db9480045fbac9fec599030','Regal Princess is clean and well-maintained, and the food is excellent.','Dining service moves slowly because the servers are stretched thin.'),
  ('rhapsody-of-the-seas','43e49cca28f5b39ebc7e42a2925101ab','Rhapsody shines for the ports you''ll visit and the dining staff who care.','The cabins feel tired and the onboard life thins out fast compared to newer ships.'),
  ('royal-princess','5626612d50b0522330c88ede864218e7','Royal Princess delivers a solid cruise experience.','The dining can swing wildly from sailing to sailing, so manage your expectations about which nights will really shine.'),
  ('ruby-princess','4bc8b56a4fd89dac630edae483ffe2d6','Ruby Princess is solid for West Coast Alaska and Mexico cruises from San Francisco.','The main dining leans bland and service can drag when the ship fills up.'),
  ('sapphire-princess','03dfb201e3f0d82344fb05c1d27fc0fb','Sapphire''s crew is warm and the itineraries are strong.','The bathrooms show real age and the fixed dining times will cost you sunset views.'),
  ('serenade-of-the-seas','8596356611badd77b4d675e76efff018','Serenade''s a comfortable size that lets you relax, and the crew keeps the whole ship running smoothly.','The cabins feel like they haven''t been refreshed in years.'),
  ('sky-princess','a55dac52446cd9b78ac1c64ddfa8bd90','Sky Princess is newer and well-maintained with good cabin space.','The dining swings wildly—breakfast is solid, the rest can feel hit-or-miss depending on what you order.'),
  ('spectrum-of-the-seas','4e2f74cee15a542055cd0e9a85d6997e','Spectrum is a sharp, well-kept ship with a friendly crew.','It''s built for a different crowd, and Western cruisers sometimes feel like guests in someone else''s home.'),
  ('star-of-the-seas','8dfcce19403d21a111056d9c0d5da23e','Star of the Seas has world-class shows and a kitchen that really knows what it''s doing.','You''re paying top dollar and the cabins are tight for the money.'),
  ('star-princess','2003c737e349824ae2584f173f310820','Star Princess is new and well-run with a crew that takes care of you and kitchens that mostly get it right.','The layout feels tight and can leave you hunting for space.'),
  ('sun-princess','724fc0d83a5d94ce942118fb1fb8f48a','Sun Princess rides smooth and the crew cares.','The food leans uneven and longtime Princess fans say she feels different from what they loved.'),
  ('symphony-of-the-seas','fa18df1c233f30285e6ee7d4b53f6309','Symphony has excellent staff and shows that make the experience feel special.','The main dining room has lost some of its edge and extras add up fast.'),
  ('utopia-of-the-seas','65d52eed230286413f6ac683d44814cd','Utopia''s new and runs smooth, which makes the short sailings feel effortless.','The crowds and constant push toward paid extras can wear on you.'),
  ('vision-of-the-seas','42b98a14d1b3f166fcf8e8fc11913837','Vision gets strong marks for crew who remember your name.','The ship''s age shows in tight dining spaces and a buffet that feels a step behind.'),
  ('voyager-of-the-seas','60390cee5d0ce99ecf5b519391382803','Voyager''s been kept up well and the crew cares.','The noise from all those water attractions means you''re signing up for a busy, family-heavy ship.'),
  ('wonder-of-the-seas','11370cac32c424ed0e81641b309e41e1','Wonder''s big and busy with plenty to do.','Expect elevator waits and book your shows early.')
  ) AS v(slug, comment_md5, why, watch)
 WHERE r.ship_slug = v.slug AND md5(btrim(r.comment)) = v.comment_md5;
